### Why this is happening

Your current architecture is effectively:

```text
inventory/dev/group_vars/all.yml
          |
          +-- ansible_user
          +-- ansible_password
          +-- ansible_become=true
          +-- ansible_become_password
                    |
                    +------ master01 ✓
                    +------ master02 ✓
                    +------ master03 ✓
                    |
                    └------ localhost  ← unwanted
```

For the remote cluster nodes, `become: true` makes sense.

For the Ansible controller itself, it usually does not.

Your Cilium playbook already says:

```yaml
- name: Install/Upgrade Cilium on RKE2 Cluster
  hosts: localhost
  connection: local
```

but `connection: local` does **not** automatically disable privilege escalation inherited from `group_vars/all.yml`.

That is the important distinction.

### Fix your playbook

Change the localhost play from:

```yaml
- name: Install/Upgrade Cilium on RKE2 Cluster
  hosts: localhost
  connection: local
  gather_facts: no
```

to:

```yaml
- name: Install/Upgrade Cilium on RKE2 Cluster
  hosts: localhost
  connection: local
  gather_facts: no
  become: false
```

So:

```yaml
---
- name: Fetch kubeconfig from RKE2 master
  hosts: "{{ groups['masters'][0] }}"
  gather_facts: false
  become: true

  roles:
    - kubeconfig

- name: Install/Upgrade Cilium on RKE2 Cluster
  hosts: localhost
  connection: local
  gather_facts: false
  become: false

  vars:
    local_kubeconfig: "/tmp/rke2-kubeconfig.yaml"
    artifactory_user: "{{ artifactory_username }}"

  environment:
    KUBECONFIG: "{{ local_kubeconfig }}"

  roles:
    - cilium
```

I would also keep this in the delegated kubeconfig task:

```yaml
delegate_to: localhost
become: false
```

which you already have:

```yaml
- name: Write kubeconfig to Ansible controller
  copy:
    content: "{{ rke2_kubeconfig_raw.content | b64decode | regex_replace('https://127.0.0.1:6443', 'https://' + hostvars[groups['masters'][0]]['ansible_host'] + ':6443') }}"
    dest: "/tmp/rke2-kubeconfig.yaml"
    mode: "0600"
  delegate_to: localhost
  become: false
```

So that part is actually correct.

